ML\"><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">↦</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\" symmetric=\"true\">‖</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\" symmetric=\"true\">‖</mo></mrow><mi>F</mi></msub></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> is nonincreasing.</p>","file":"ch13-psd-and-svd/11-low-rank-approximation.html"}